+# Validate task input
+
+- `add`, `rename` and `tag` reject invalid input with an `invalid-input` error whose message says what is wrong; the list is left unchanged.
+- Title: empty or only spaces, or longer than 120 characters (after trimming), is rejected.
+- Priority: anything other than `low`, `normal`, `high` is rejected (checked at run time, as screens pass raw input).
+- Tag: empty, or containing whitespace, is rejected; this covers the tags given to `add` as well as `tag`.
+- Errors are returned as a `Result` (rule r4); tests in `test/list.test.ts`.
